cG.M.M..p....Gc...c...c...c
ccccqcccc.L.L.R.1.P.1.P.1.c
cG.M.M.Gc1.V..c...c...c...cH
c.1...1.q.L.L.ccZccczccc+cc.
cM.2N2..cG.1..R...c...c...c.
